   :measured "2026-08-20 on this machine, both directions observed before registering:
                real chart                       ~3s  -> SCANNED 712, 0 findings, exit 0
                override removed for one account      -> 1 finding, section-requires-subdivision,
                                                         naming その他有価証券評価差額金, exit 1
                one :revenue flipped to :expense      -> 1 finding, section-type-conflict,
                                                         naming DE-SCHOOL売上, exit 1
                one account deleted from the chart    -> exit 3, refuses, prints NO coverage
                shohyo replaced by an empty stub      -> exit 3, refuses (bs=0 pl=0)
              The stub case is the one worth having: with an empty namespace every check
